      {% include "epigraph.njk" %}
      <p>Some of my favorite work happens in a room full of people who each know a different piece of the problem. I bring engineers and subject-matter experts together to work through real problems, and I ask a lot of questions along the way. With Denver Water, I built the Storm Kit, a tool that improved water quality prediction and suggested additional datasets and sensors that could improve their predictions. I've run Design Storms and EventStorms, as well as workshops at conferences in the US and Europe. I help organizations make their business and architectural decisions, and figure out where their domain boundaries belong.</p>
      <p class="muted">I offer leadership and team coaching, domain-modeling sprint design, agentic AI optimization, working sessions, team offsites and workshops, hourly, by the project or by the block of time. I work alongside you directly, because the people who live with a system are the ones who know where it hurts.</p>
